{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_02_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_02","title":"另一個視角","storyCode":"MB-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1bd19749d1556505513187d5c71a4c8f80e6f4ace5558afb47c09add83f96cda","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"相比卡夫卡的視角，繆爾賽思似乎更在意安東尼的隊伍中的另一個人——羅賓的視角，在她的要求下，赫默轉換了描述的視角。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，讓我們繼續吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者和非感染者的地位在監獄中反而得到了平等，真是有夠諷刺的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......那不能叫做平等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，確實，如果不被當作人對待才能獲得平等，那麼這種平等還是不要為好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能換個話題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒有打算把這個話題繼續下去，高高在上地聊這樣的話題晚上會睡不好的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，卡夫卡進入監獄的時間，應該是現在的四個半月前，越獄發生的四個月前，曼斯菲爾德監獄正停靠在聖蘇菲城的時候吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，更早的話，就要往一年前去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟作為移動監獄，它除了每隔幾個月會前往周邊都市補充資源和接收囚犯之外，平時基本上是停在荒野上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"用四個月來策劃一起越獄，時間說不上短，不過也不能算很長呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等等，這裡我有一個疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你提出的規則，該輪到我提問了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，也是，那麼請吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那之前，梅爾，能麻煩你幫我們做些吃的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，可以哦，不過我不知道這裡的廚房能不能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"可以哦，考慮到這次的談話時間可能很長，我其實準備了不少食材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾小姐會下廚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我會哦。畢竟我是一人工作室，不會做飯的話早就餓死啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然萊茵生命和羅德島都有食堂，不過有時候走過去會很麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們繼續聊，我去給你們做點吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"做之前記得檢查一下食材哦？我可不想被說在食材上動手腳呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好好~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是......友善。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我說了，我是來和你談話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是你，為什麼特意把梅爾小姐支開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我還沒有告訴梅爾，海德兄弟的背後是能量科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_3add"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事難道不是你們兩個人一起策劃的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我原本不打算告訴她，她只是陪我來這邊採購一些器材的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，因為能量科和工程科走得很近，不希望讓她有不好的想法嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然她不是共犯，那麼告訴她有相當的風險哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用你提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，我想知道的是，在這件事情中，能量科究竟站在什麼樣的位置上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"海德兄弟的背後是能量科，但這一次的事情本身與能量科無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"是海德兄弟借用了能量科的資源策劃了這起刺殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，輪到我提問了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，在安東尼逃獄的幫手中，除了一位原本是監獄入殮師的杜瑪小姐，還有一名叫做羅賓的女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"而奇怪的是，我的情報顯示，她本應該是前往刺殺安東尼的殺手之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"但根據你剛才的說法，你的助手似乎只有卡夫卡小姐一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"難道羅賓並不是你的安排？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來你確實對越獄的過程一無所知，繆爾賽思主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就說過了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，你搞錯了一件事，我並沒有情報靈通到瞭解這場刺殺會發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我事先對此有所瞭解，那麼我不會只讓卡夫卡一個人潛入監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這對她太危險了，而且在這種情況下，她一個人能發揮的力量也有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，你只是掌握了安東尼這條線索？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我在半年前才發現安東尼並沒有和他的家人被關在同一座監獄這件事，然後我就安排了卡夫卡進入監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時的想法是，如果能見到他並協助他越獄自然最好，如果做不到，那就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......然後正好撞上了這場刺殺嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，這樣想來確實合理很多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，告訴我這件事真的好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓我保持著你是為了阻止這場刺殺而行動的印象的話，會讓我覺得你厲害很多哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不擅長做這種事，繆爾賽思主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此，一開始我以為你是我的同類，現在來看，你其實和梅爾小姐才是一類人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過有什麼原因讓你在最喜愛的研究之餘，不得不關心一些自己原本不在意的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"而這個原因，我猜，是“炎魔”，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"那件事與這次的事情無關，繆爾賽思主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是為了伊芙利特而來，那麼我們的談話就到此為止吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉抱歉，是我多嘴了，放心，我對這件事也只是有所耳聞，並不知道究竟發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"為了表達我的歉意，我就免費贈送你一個問題吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不需要你的歉意，只要你能不再提起這件事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那麼請繼續剛才的話題吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......總之，對我來說，這場刺殺也是完全的意外，我沒想到海德兄弟會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"會這麼想，說明你還不完全瞭解能量科那位的作風呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼是一個隱患，而那位不容許一點隱患和無法掌控的事存在，一旦被他知道他們竟然留下了這樣的手尾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒楣的就是他們兄弟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他們花了幾年精心策劃了這場刺殺，就是為了切實地將安東尼葬送在監獄中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......為了掩蓋自己做的惡事，不得不做更多的惡事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人反胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有些事情是沒有辦法回頭的哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"說回那名殺手，既然那個叫做羅賓的殺手背後不是你，就只剩下一種可能了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"羅賓是中途反叛的殺手，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，可以麻煩你切換一下視角嗎？我有點好奇這位殺手小姐在監獄裡的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"既然她和安東尼一起逃了出來，想必你也確認過她的身份和經歷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅賓，她一開始確實是被派遣進入監獄刺殺安東尼的殺手之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡的回憶裡那場雙方囚犯之間的衝突發生時，她也剛進入監獄沒多久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["赫默"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]}]}
